# Claude Code's per-checkout state. Not all of `.claude/`: `settings.json` is
# shared project configuration and is tracked on purpose. What is ignored is
# the machine-local half.
#
# `worktrees/` is the one that bites: those are checkouts of this same
# repository, so an unguarded `git add -A` records them as embedded repos.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
